d>\n<td>25.5-30 kg / 56.2-66.1 lbs</td>\n<td>136-145 cm / 53.5-57.1 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>50 cm / 19.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>47 cm / 18.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>30.5-40 kg / 67.2-88.2 lbs</td>\n<td>145-155 cm / 57.1-61 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>53 cm / 20.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>50 cm / 19.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>45-55 kg / 99.2-121.3 lbs</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>57 cm / 22.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.5 in</td>\n<td>48 cm / 18.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>55.5-65 kg / 122.4-143.3 lbs</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>51 cm / 20.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The French Garden Mommy and Me Set is made for soft summer days, family photos, and easy mother-daughter dressing. Choose the floral strap dress for the main matching moment, then add the lightweight cardigan when you want a little extra coverage without losing the airy look.</p>\n\n<p>The ivory floral palette keeps the outfit sweet and wearable, while the tiered dress shape and open cardigan layer give each size a relaxed, graceful fit. Each garment is selected separately by Type and Size so families can build the exact matching look they need.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Two coordinated pieces:</strong> Select the Dress or Cardigan by Type for mom and daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft floral look:</strong> Ivory base with delicate pastel garden florals.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Layer-ready styling:</strong> Wear the dress alone or pair it with the matching cardigan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family photo friendly:</strong> Gentle colors and flowing lines work beautifully for summer portraits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed sizing:</strong> Every variant comes from the supplied size chart.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose Dress or Cardigan, then pick each size to create a French Garden matching look for mom and mini.</p>",
